{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#467","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#467","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#467\",\"parent_revision\":\"51da1681509893740a947d69455457d21c38ea56b7cfb66e7bc6328d7f306613\",\"root_revision\":\"51da1681509893740a947d69455457d21c38ea56b7cfb66e7bc6328d7f306613\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: \\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: closed\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nbacklog_core defines no `@mcp.prompt` components. MCP prompts are reusable, parameterized message templates that guide AI clients through multi-step workflows. They are distinct from tools \u2014 clients render prompts as conversation starters, not function calls.\\n\\nbacklog_core workflows have natural prompt candidates:\\n- `add_backlog_item(title, description, type)` \u2192 prompt that guides the AI to provide the correct fields and call backlog_add\\n- `groom_item(selector)` \u2192 prompt that frames the grooming workflow for a specific item\\n- `review_priority_section(section)` \u2192 prompt for reviewing all items in a priority section\\n- `close_or_resolve_item(selector)` \u2192 prompt that guides the distinction between close (dismiss) and resolve (complete)\\n\\nFiles affected: `.claude/skills/backlog/backlog_core/server.py`\\n\\nSource: FastMCP v3 docs `servers/prompts.mdx` \u2014 `@mcp.prompt` registers a reusable message template; clients invoke via `prompts/get`.\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **developer using Claude Code skills**, I want to **add mcp prompts to backlog_core for common workflow guidance** so that **the tooling becomes more capable and complete**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: fastmcp-creator skill review of backlog_core/server.py\\n- **Priority**: P2\\n- **Added**: 2026-03-06\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"1087615279ba5bfd782d7bdfe23fc1a268afe4cc80750584299447003d12c625\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABVWf6zg\"}"}